      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "EN 1993-1-1:2005 + A1:2014. The check runs in this order, each step using the results before it:",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_secchs_3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 156,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "section properties and yield strength (3) → class, Table 5.2 (4) → cross-section resistance §6.2 (5, 6) →",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_secchs_4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 181,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "member buckling §6.3: compression (7), lateral-torsional buckling (8), compression with bending (9) → summary (10).",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_secchs_5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 206,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "Uniform member, Class 1 to 3; Annex B (Method 2) for the interaction factors.",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_secchs_6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 231,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "N positive in compression, negative in tension. Moments and shears in either sign; magnitudes are used.",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_secchs_7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 256,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "Not covered: Class 4, torsion, holes and net sections, shear buckling, fire, connections. N &lt; 0 (tension):",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_secchs_8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 281,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "no compression buckling; LTB and the interaction run with N = 0 (no tension credit).",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_secchs_9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 306,
      "props": {
